				},
				{
					"id": 200230902,
					"content": "宁禄正在努力戒酒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200230903,
					"content": "正在努力戒酒…是这样吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维多利亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 200230904,
					"content": "但是没有证据…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230905
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200230905,
					"content": "没关系，只要你们没有找到他喝酒的证据，我就可以认为他正在悔改了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维多利亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 200230906,
					"content": "在没有证据之前，我一直相信，每个人都是无罪的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维多利亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 200230907,
					"content": "但是…总是会有各种各样的证据，证明着他们的各种「罪孽」…真是好笑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200230908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维多利亚"
				},
				{
